  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fas II av ACCORDs &quot;Sydsudan Initiativ&quot; har fyra m&#xe5;l:                  Kapacitetsf&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning f&#xf6;r konflikthantering / medling av regering    och civilsamh&#xe4;llet; fr&#xe4;mja dialogen f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kat politiskt engagemang och medborgarinflytande; &#xf6;kad policy forskning med tonvikt p&#xe5; strategier  f&#xf6;r konflikthantering, politisk h&#xf6;gniv&#xe5; dialog.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of ACCORD&apos;s &quot;South Sudan Initiative&quot; has four objectives:    Conflict Management/Mediation Capacity Enhancement for GoSS and Civil Society; Promoting Dialogue for increased Political Engagement and    Citizen Participation; Increased Policy Research Highlighting         Strategies for Conflict Mitigation; High Level Political Dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
